<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News says plans U.S. Sky network.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News says plans U.S. Sky network.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global media group News Corp Ltd said on Tuesday its plans to launch its ASkyB U.S. satellite television network by November 1, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;ASkyB, which will have 200 channels, we plan to launch by November 1, next year,&quot; News Corp chairman and chief executive Rupert Murdoch told the annual meeting in Adelaide.  </p>
<p>The satellite pay tv operation is a joint venture between News Corp and MCI Communications Corp.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
